<title>UK: Laporte falls on stock overhang.</title>
<headline>Laporte falls on stock overhang.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in speciality chemicals producer Laporte Plc dropped on Friday as a line of stock hung over the market, dealers said.</p>
<p>Laporte's often-volatile stock fell 16-1/2p to 632-1/2p by 0905 GMT in volume of 331,000 shares.</p>
<p>&quot;The only thing we've heard is that there is a bad book position in the market,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
<p>The shares have tumbled from their year high of 723p on March 13 towards their year low of 622p set on February 28.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Langlands, London Newsroom +44 171 542 3496</p>
